      "id": "claim_372ac1bb1b9d4867861cb2a184b01cdf",
      "statement": "The harbor-langfuse plugin satisfies Harbor's job-plugin contract by duck typing (no Harbor import): on_job_start derives a RunContext and ensures the Langfuse dataset <catalog>/<skill> exists with one item per case, and on_job_end converts every trial into a record and writes the run through run_experiment, then flushes.",
