    {
      "id": "claim_701ec616cba94d9dac06922354034a94",
      "statement": "The catalog CI template's evals job runs only on a push to main when the repository variable HARNESS_EVALS is true, takes its matrix directly from the JSON-array variable HARNESS_EVALS_AGENTS (default [\"claude-code\", \"codex\"]), and consists of checkout, uv, the deploy-key credential action and a single harness-catalog ci evals --agent call from the pinned CLI tag; GitLab lists the agents in parallel.matrix because it cannot build a matrix from a variable.",
      "evidence": [
