    {
      "id": "claim_34e647dfcabd467995b97b887b4d33d3",
      "statement": "harness-catalog ci evals checks credentials before anything else — missing_credentials applies a per-harness table (claude-code: OAuth token with CLAUDE_FORCE_OAUTH=1 or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY; codex: OPENAI_API_KEY or CODEX_FORCE_AUTH_JSON=1 with auth.json; cursor-cli and gemini-cli their keys) and missing_langfuse requires the three Langfuse keys — exiting 1 with the missing item named, exits 2 when the base commit or diff cannot be determined, and does nothing when no skill changed.",
